<title>POLAND: Gorazdze Q2 net rises to PLN 27.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Gorazdze Q2 net rises to PLN 27.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gorazdze preliminary results for the second  quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			24.97 vs     13.61</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  27.16 vs     20.08</p>
<p>    net profit				27.06 vs     20.04</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Zaklady Cementowo-Wapiennicze Gorazdze  SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 86.55 vs     66.02</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  47.19 vs     34.14</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.13 loss</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.10 vs	0.04</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     3.78 vs	6.76</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.58 vs	0.15</p>
<p>    investment				16.03 vs	5.04</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			19.53 vs	7.52</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  24.33 vs     19.17</p>
<p>    net profit				24.22 vs     19.12</p>
<p>    net sales				123.67 vs     92.46</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  81.06 vs     58.96</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.13 loss</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.10 vs	0.04</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     6.50 vs     12.18</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.70 vs	0.40</p>
<p>    investment				39.45 vs     10.90</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
